 cy='68' r='4' fill='#1E7BE0'/><text x='629' y='74' font-size='16' fill='#333A45' text-anchor='start' font-weight='400'>未发现已可直接供 DSH 或 WorkBuddy 使用的完整 StudyAgent MCP 服务及可安装适配包</text><circle cx='613' cy='102' r='4' fill='#1E7BE0'/><text x='629' y='108' font-size='16' fill='#333A45' text-anchor='start' font-weight='400'>内部工具的参数描述目前是字符串形式的示例，仍需转换和校验为真正的协议输入结构</text><circle cx='613' cy='136' r='4' fill='#1E7BE0'/><text x='629' y='142' font-size='16' fill='#333A45' text-anchor='start' font-weight='400'>ROADMAP.md 仍将面向外部调用的 MCP 和专用 Agent 列为后续工作</text></svg></Box><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', background: '#F5F7FA', borderLeft: '4px solid #E8A33D', borderRadius: 6, padding: '14px 20px' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#0E2340', fontWeight: 600, lineHeight: 1.5 }}>四个交付层次必须区分：已有 HTTP API、内部工具表、外部 MCP 服务、宿主插件，不能互相替代宣称</Text></Box></Box></Box><Box style={{ height: 40, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center', borderTop: '1px solid #E3E8EF', marginTop: 8 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#7A8699', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.4 }}>依据：系统Agent适配与MCP插件接入设计.md §3</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#7A8699', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.4 }}> 89 / 124 </Text></Box></Slide>